WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.610
m 0 0 l 0 0 l 0 0 l 22.5 0 l 22.5 -22.5 l 0 -22.5

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.610
Winter, Keio Era, 1866

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.380
It's gotten colder recently.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.250
Yeah.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.280
Um, Saitou-san?

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.780
Sorry, we're in the middle of our patrol.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.910
You wore a very happy expression.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.410
Did you see a good katana?

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.410
Bizen Osafune Kanemitsu.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.080
No swords are more significant than those of Bizen.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.210
Out of swords from Bizen, none are 
finer than those of the Osafune School.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.670
There were many excellent swordsmiths in Bizen.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.920
This was created by a swordsmith who stood out among even them.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:10.430
Bizen Kuni Kanemitsu

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:10.430
Bizen Kuni Kanemitsu

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.590
When you think about excellent swordsmiths,

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.430
you think about those who have surpassed Bizen's swordsmiths.

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:15.180
Like the works of Awataguchi of the Yamashiro style and the Rai School, a rival of Kuniie.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.900
Also, there is a student of Shintogo Kunimitsu from the Soshu style,

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:24.110
Priest Gorou Masamune, who is considered to have brought to perfection the art of nie.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:26.320
What?

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.570
I'm sure I did not say anything you could laugh at.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:34.540
Did I mention some wrong facts?

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.540
No, that's not it.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:36.870
Then why did you laugh?

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.960
Ah, well...

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.250
I was thinking that you really like katanas, Saitou-san.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:47.430
The blades themselves are fascinating,

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.470
but there is a hidden meaning to them.

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.680
A hidden meaning?

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:59.350
A katana is used to take the life of your opponent,

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.190
and that's it.

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.900
It is a simple and clear existence.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.070
doko e mukau? makoto no fune

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.070
Where are you heading? Oh, boat of truth!

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:19.460
atsuki kokorozashi kakagete

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:19.460
As you carry a burning desire.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.830
Fansubbed by Ruri Subs

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:22.670
Fansubbed by Ruri Subs

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:31.260
hageshii nagare no kawa ni sakarau you ni

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:31.260
It's like you're going against the raging river's current.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:37.890
anata ga hitaburu tada susumu no nara

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:37.890
As long as you carry on with that determination,

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:46.610
tsuite yukitai saki ga miezu tomo

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:46.610
I shall follow you, despite being unable to see what lies ahead.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:53.660
haruka gekiryuu no hate wo shinji nagara

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:53.660
I also believe in what's ahead of the raging stream.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:03:01.540
mumyou no yami no naka de samayou yoru ni wa

00:02:53.660 --> 00:03:01.540
Wandering around in a pitch-black night,

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:10.970
kasukana hi wo tomoshitai chiisaki kono te de

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:10.970
I will light the dreary lamp with these hands of mine.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.390
doko e mukau? aoki fune yo

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.390
Where are you going? Oh, blue boat!

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:20.180
mienai asu e mukai

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:20.180
As you head toward an uncertain tomorrow.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.060
subete wo kakete inochi wo kakete

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.060
Staking everything, even your life,

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:30.530
tooki mahoroba wo sagashite

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:30.530
to search for your distant paradise.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:42.080
Chapter 2

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:42.080
The Fire Hidden
 in Winter

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.500
That won't work!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.260
It's too dangerous to use Chizuru as a spy in Shimabara!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.260
I want to be of use to everyone.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:56.850
But still...

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:59.770
Are those samurai from Choushuu?

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.770
Who knows?

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.480
I'm against it.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.860
What do we do when something happens?

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:09.780
Hijikata-kun, perhaps you have another idea?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:13.030
We could send a scout. There are other ways around it.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.490
If we were not short on time, we could do that.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:19.290
But this is an emergency.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.580
I believe sending Yukimura-kun as a spy would be the best method.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.720
Eavesdropping while behaving as a geiko in front of the samurai

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.890
should be possible even for Chizuru-chan.

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:38.810
Right?

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:39.680
Yes!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:46.850
Well, if she doesn't make a serious mistake, I don't think she'll get busted.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:51.480
Chizuru looked just like a real geiko back then.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.320
True!

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.530
It'd be my pleasure to meet Shimabara's most beautiful woman again.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.570
Th-That's a little...

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:03.960
Vice-Commander, please allow Yamazaki and me to infiltrate Sumiya as Yukimura's escort.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.580
Please leave it to us.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.710
That will be fine.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.960
Thank you.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.920
All right, if anything happens, notify me immediately.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.880
I'll deal with it right away.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.890
Yukimura-kun, this may trouble you,

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:19.850
but I'm counting on you!

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:20.810
All right!

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:26.310
Don't worry. As soon as we finish
our patrol, we'll head to Shimabara.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:29.110
Yeah! We'll have a drink!

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:29.110
I'll leave this to you.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:31.690
Will this really be all right?

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.990
Those people  in Shimabara are vile-natured drunkards.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:37.320
Yet, she has to pour them wine,

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.870
flatter them,

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.280
get touched by them...

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.770
It sure looks good on you.

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.100
Chizuru-chan, you look so pretty!

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.650
I knew this kimono would fit you best.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:16.570
I can't help but think that it's a waste
 for you to do this for those dirty men.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.070
Not at all.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:21.740
By the way, I didn't know you two were acquainted.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:29.920
Um, how should I deal with the customers?

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:34.460
I thought a geiko needed to dance and play the shamisen or something?

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.800
Pouring them wine will be enough.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.170
Really?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:41.300
You're so beautiful, so don't worry.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.800
Have some confidence!

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.940
Yamazaki, are you there?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.110
Yes.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.690
If there is an even slightly wrong move...

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.110
I know.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:17.960
Damn those stray dogs of the Shogunate.

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:20.880
No one's afraid of the Shinsengumi!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.720
One day, I'll bewilder them!

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.220
You have a brilliant plan or something?

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:30.230
These people are really planning to attack the headquarters.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:31.940
What's the matter?

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.940
I-It's nothing.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.400
If those meddlesome Shinsengumi are gone,

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.110
the Tokugawa era would be long over.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:47.120
If we succeeded, I'd get a great reward for my accomplishments!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.120
Especially you.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:53.750
Have you decided on a future husband yet?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.250
Eh? Ah, no.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:08:00.380
How about it? If you'd like to become my mistress, you should take this chance.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.630
Eh? No, I'm...

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.470
How innocent.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.350
Um...

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:10.980
The bottle... The bottle is empty.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.770
I'll bring you another one.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.360
Hey, did you wait long?

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.030
Stay away!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:30.290
So, this is when they pretend to hate what they like?

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:36.040
What's wrong?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.340
You're not running anymore?

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.720
Yamazaki-san!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.010
Who the hell are you?

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:48.930
That's a weird outfit. Who are you?!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.220
I-I'm...

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.350
As you can see, I'm a ninja.

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:57.480
A ninja?

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:59.610
A ninja?

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:02.490
Have you been eavesdropping?!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.900
No!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:09.240
I'm a ninja who protects the cute princess 
from the shadows on windy and rainy days!

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.370
P-Princess?!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.830
I will appear whenever there's a scream for help!

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:16.620
You bastard! What do you intend to do to our princess?!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.750
U-Um, Yamazaki-san...

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.960
Play along for now.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:22.880
It'll be a problem if we get busted now.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:25.930
You've been spouting nothing but nonsense!

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:29.050
Hand over that woman right now!

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:29.050
Princess, this way!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:37.060
I, the ninja, Yamazaki, will protect you with my life!

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:38.350
O-Okay!

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.490
Where did they go?

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:48.490
Bitch, you come out now!

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.490
He's not giving up.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.250
Where are you?!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:00.670
Yamazaki-san, don't worry about me.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:04.170
Yamazaki-san, you should get out-

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.170
What are you saying, Princess?

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:07.680
There's no way I could abandon you and escape on my own.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.270
There you are.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:18.020
Now, come here.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:20.810
The game's over.

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.030
Yamazaki Style...

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:29.160
Ninpou, Tatami Flip!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.040
A ninja?!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:35.740
Where?!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.290
Damn that guy.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:41.000
Princess, leave this to me and run.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:41.670
Now!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.420
A-All right!

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.050
Wha...

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:57.060
Aren't you that geiko?

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:05.690
What's wrong?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.820
You didn't have to run.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.950
Now, let's return. Come.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.410
Wait! Please let go!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.330
That's as far as you go.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.080
Saitou-san!

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.880
Any further harassment,

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.340
and I will not forgive you.

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:27.880
Who the hell are you?

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.880
This has nothing to do with you!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.970
Get lost!

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.350
Unfortunately, it does have something to do with me.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.980
I'm the guardian of this Sumiya.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:43.100
G-Guardian?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:48.230
I am employed to protect the geiko from unreasonable guests.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.500
You're... Yukimura, right?

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.250
Y-Yes, I am.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.750
It's the first time I've seen you in makeup.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.460
I didn't think there'd be such a difference.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:13.550
You're dressed up this way just to help us.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:13.550
You bastard! Are you underestimating me?

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:18.970
I thought you might be doing this unwillingly.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.100
However, still...

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.980
I hope to remove any feelings of regret I may have.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.310
So, I should tell you now...

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.020
Hey, look here!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.400
Don't go creating your own world by ignoring me!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.400
You taking me for a fool?!

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.410
Saitou-san!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.740
It's not the time for that.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.370
Yukimura.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.040
There's something I must tell you.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.500
Will you listen to my words?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.620
Ah, um...

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.790
How dare you?!

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.930
I'm sorry.

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:59.890
When I see you dressed like this,

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:01.890
it makes me a little nervous.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.810
Ah, um...

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.310
We could talk about it later,

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.230
but right now...

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.150
I found them!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:12.940
This way!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.950
No, it would not serve its purpose if it is not now.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:18.030
Please listen to me, Yukimura.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.160
Prepare yourself for this.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.710
What is the meaning of this?

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.960
Y-You bastard.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.590
Not once but twice...

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.500
What do you want?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.010
We are having a conversation.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:36.880
If you want to talk, we can do that later.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.180
What was that, you bastard?!

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.600
He's looking down on us!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:48.480
Whenever an important conversation is interrupted, it puts me in a foul mood.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:52.110
I won't be able to hold back.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.370
If you really must fight,

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.210
I'll take you on.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:27.640
Hijikata-san!

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.150
Chizuru?

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:34.150
Ah, yes.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:39.280
You were really incredible back there, Saitou-san.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.160
No, it was nothing.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:46.290
You didn't even get a scratch against more than ten samurai.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:52.790
That reminds me. Didn't you want to tell me something important, Saitou-san?

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:56.550
That was, well...

00:14:56.550 --> 00:15:01.550
Could it have been about my appearance as a geiko?

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.430
N-No, well...

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.560
I guess it didn't suit me, huh?

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.810
I have the face of a child, after all.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:11.520
This is quite a difficult problem.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:14.400
Right now and back then are completely different situations.

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.440
What I wanted to say back then was...

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:27.370
Oh, right. Everyone was discussing whether Hijikata-san would look good with a beard.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:31.250
But I don't think a beard would suit Hijikata-san, right?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.960
...it was perfectly suited.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.210
Eh?

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.380
Did you see it before?

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:38.880
What are you talking about?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.970
On that day in Shimabara, I saw it.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:47.220
Eh?! You mean Hijikata-san went to Shimabara with a beard?

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:51.350
Hold on. Just what are you talking about?

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:56.400
I was talking about whether or not 
Hijikata-san looks good with a beard.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:00.360
I have never seen that before, nor do I think it'd fit him.

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:06.240
Though, if the vice-commander was determined, I wouldn't mind.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:11.750
Then when you said "It was perfectly suited," what were you referring to?

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.330
Th-That's...

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.340
Enough. It's a thing of the past. Let's go.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.800
Ah, wait, Saitou-san!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:34.770
Itou's group is already recruiting new members.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:38.770
He'll request to leave soon, won't he?

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.160
Nobody from the group knows about this.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:47.320
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:50.330
I think this will be a lonely and lengthy mission,

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.160
but I'm counting on you.

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:54.370
No need to worry.

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:58.290
Even when far away, my heart will always be here.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.420
That will never change.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:05.010
I'll be waiting. You must come back in one piece.

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:06.470
Right.

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:20.320
The blades themselves are fascinating,

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:23.190
but there is a hidden meaning to them.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.490
A hidden meaning?

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:31.450
A katana is used to take the life of your opponent,

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.120
and that's it.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:36.210
It is a simple and clear existence.

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:45.050
Without any hesitation, all movements depends on the user.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:47.180
I want to become like that.

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.730
Huh? Saitou-san?

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:01.940
It's you.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:04.480
You're up pretty early today.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.860
So are you, Saitou-san.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:09.200
What are you doing here all by yourself?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.540
I had just been in the dojo practicing with my sword.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:19.630
When I came out and saw it snowing, I stopped to look.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.750
That's all.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.710
Well, if that's the case, you should wipe off your sweat first,

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.380
otherwise you'll catch a cold.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:31.430
Shouldn't you be back inside warming yourself by the brazier, too?

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.510
They say a cold is the root of all illnesses.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.900
Saitou-san, do you like snow?

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:43.400
Snow is a really inconceivable thing.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.400
Huh?

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:51.490
When I look at it in this scenery, I feel like I've cast myself off.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.370
It immerses me in it.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:58.040
Aren't you going back inside?

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.920
I'll stay here for a little longer.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:04.750
I'll watch the snow with you.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.420
You sure are a curious one.

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:16.390
Hey, Saitou-san.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.350
Yes?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:21.140
Since it's snowing, we shouldn't just watch.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.310
Shall we have some fun?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:24.730
Fun?

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.940
What are you planning to do?

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:30.570
We could build a snowman or snow huts.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:33.320
That sounds truly childish.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.120
Oh, really?

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.120
So, I am childish?

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.830
That wasn't what I meant to say.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.080
Don't mind me.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.170
But, unfortunately,

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:49.840
not enough snow has accumulated to build a snowman.

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.340
That's true.

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:58.220
How about we make a snow rabbit?

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:01.060
What is a snow rabbit?

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:02.730
You don't know?

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:08.320
Every time it snowed when I was small, I'd make one for my father.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:10.780
Pardon my ignorance. I've never heard of it.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.280
Give me a second!

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:16.450
Hey, you don't have to make one for me.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.870
No problem. I'll be done in a second.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:24.460
Here.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.130
I see. So this is a snow rabbit.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.720
Cute, isn't it?

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.510
This is for you, Saitou-san.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:37.890
What should I do with this?

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:41.350
You don't like this kind of thing?

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:42.270
Not really...

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:44.520
Your hands have gotten cold.

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:48.400
It's better for you to go back inside and warm yourself up.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:54.150
What's wrong? Your face has also turned red.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.450
Did you get frostbite?

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:58.660
N-No, it's not that.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:04.370
I guess it's time to go back inside.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:08.670
If you caught a cold, I wouldn't know how I'd explain it to the vice-commander.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.050
All right!

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:13.800
I shall accept this snow rabbit. Thank you.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:17.680
It's too bad that it'll melt instantly.

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:35.010
furitsumu kazahana wo

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:35.010
In the winter wind, the snow piles up.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:40.350
kata wo narabe nagame teru

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:40.350
I look at them as they stack.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:48.110
te wo nobaseba todoku kyori wo

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:48.110
If I extend my arms, I'll come closer to it,

00:21:48.810 --> 00:21:52.350
modokashiku omou

00:21:48.810 --> 00:21:52.350
though I may be impatient.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:58.170
shisen ga kasanaru tabi kanjiru

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:58.170
I felt it the moment our eyes met,

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:04.940
kono munasawagi wa nani darou

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:04.940
but what is this feeling of uneasiness?

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:11.290
utsumuite kotoba nomikonde wa

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:11.290
I accepted those discouraging words.

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:16.850
sunao ni narezu ni mata

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:16.850
I obediently get used to it

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:22.480
kajikamu te nigirishimeta

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:22.480
and I held my cold and numb hands once again.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:29.420
konna kimochi hajimete shittanda

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:29.420
This is the first time I felt like this.

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:34.630
dareka wo omou shiawase

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:34.630
It's a happiness I felt for someone.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:44.230
towa ni tsumugu omoi wo kazahana ni nosete

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:44.230
These feelings will forever stay in eternity on the winter winds,

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:50.060
anata made todokeru kara

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:50.060
and I'm sure they will reach you,

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:56.390
"kawaranaide ite…"

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:56.390
telling you to stay true to yourself...

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:04.530
Harada-san, you're really kind.

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:07.000
Why are you so popular?!

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:09.920
That man is unexpectedly hardheaded.

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:14.090
A real man never makes excuses.

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:15.170
Chapter 3

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:15.170
The Sky-Piercing
 Spear
